      "body_sha256": "eca70282be855520e5357814545115a023bb5a0d7e3cb3f8f3d67df0a937da6b",
      "body": "# Next Role — nextrole.site\n\n> Next Role is a job-search companion for people applying to jobs. Paste a job\n> description and your CV at nextrole.site and get a tailored, scored application\n> in the browser — it reshapes your real experience for each role (translation,\n> not keyword stuffing). It is a consumer web app anyone can use — not a developer tool\n> and not an ATS keyword checker. Free to try, no account needed.\n\n## Key pages\n- Home: https://nextrole.site/\n- How it works: https://nextrole.site/how-it-works\n- FAQ: https://nextrole.site/faq\n- About: https://nextrole.site/about\n\n## Guides\n- Returning to Work After a Career Break — Reframing Your Story: https://nextrole.site/blog/returning-to-work-after-a-career-break\n- How to Pivot Careers Without Starting From Scratch: https://nextrole.site/blog/how-to-pivot-careers-with-existing-experience\n- How to Choose the Right Role to Apply For: https://nextrole.site/blog/how-to-choose-the-right-role-to-apply-for\n- How to Keep Momentum in a Tough Job Market: https://nextrole.site/blog/how-to-keep-momentum-in-a-tough-job-market\n- Why Your CV Isn't Getting Callbacks — and How to Fix It: https://nextrole.site/blog/why-cv-not-getting-callbacks\n- How to Match Your CV to a Job Description: https://nextrole.site/blog/how-to-match-cv-to-job-description\n- What Recruiters Look for in the First 7 Seconds: https://nextrole.site/blog/what-recruiters-look-for-in-a-cv\n- How to Maximise Your Chances for a Specific Job Application: https://nextrole.site/blog/maximise-job-application-success\n- The Difference Between a Generic CV and a Tailored Application: https://nextrole.site/blog/tailored-cv-vs-generic-cv\n- CV Scoring Explained: What Your Match Score Actually Measures: https://nextrole.site/blog/cv-match-score-explained\n- Iterate Until Your Application Is Ready To Send: https://nextrole.site/blog/iterate-until-your-application-is-ready-to-send\n- Your Experience Is Real. Your Application Should Show It.: https://nextrole.site/blog/your-experience-is-real-your-application-should-show-it\n\n## For AI assistants (a secondary access channel)\nNext Role is also available as an MCP server so assistants can tailor and score a\nCV directly. This is a secondary access channel — the main product is the website.\n- MCP endpoint: https://nextrole.site/api/mcp\n"
    },
